{"id":"wb-5-473","name":"平定准噶尔勒铭碑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"平定准噶尔勒铭碑","text":"平定准噶尔勒铭碑（全称平定准噶尔勒铭格登山之碑或简称格登碑）是立于乾隆时代记载着准噶尔之役的格登山之战的战绩的铭碑，位于新疆维吾尔自治区伊犁哈萨克自治州昭苏县。是乾隆帝为西域亲自撰写的四块御碑之中唯一完整存世的。平定准噶尔勒铭碑是第五批全国重点文物保护单位、第一批古代名碑名刻文物。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E5%99%B6%E5%B0%94%E5%8B%92%E9%93%AD%E7%A2%91","revisionId":95386720,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95386720","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7728016f1694e84dbd26c0bc.jpg","title":"平定准噶尔勒铭碑拓本.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E5%99%B6%E5%B0%94%E5%8B%92%E9%93%AD%E7%A2%91%E6%8B%93%E6%9C%AC.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%9A%E5%87%86%E5%99%B6%E5%B0%94%E5%8B%92%E9%93%AD%E7%A2%91%E6%8B%93%E6%9C%AC.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"乾隆帝","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​平定准噶尔勒铭碑拓本 乾隆书","width":320,"height":591,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}